  "Starting per the strategy: Court, 'the sites that come with', Prepared Defenses, No Bargain, Oppressive Enforcement and There Is No Try; several Effects start, so starting.effect is left empty. Total 60 as published.",
  "Posted 'Iggy with gun' dested IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Boba with gun' Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; '4-lom with gun' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Dengar with gun' Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'Mara' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Mara's stick' Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Dr. E.' Dr. Evazan.",
  "Posted 'Bossk/Zuckuss/Dengar/Ig-88 in Boat' dested Bossk In Hound's Tooth, Zuckuss In Mist Hunter, Dengar In Punishing One and IG-88 In IG-2000.",
  "Posted 'Chal Bekan' dested Chall Bekan; 'Beolo' Boelo; 'Galid' Gailid; 'Danik jerriko' Dannik Jerriko; 'U-3PO' U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Hut Smooch' Hutt Smooch; 'Tatooinejunland wastes' Tatooine: Jundland Wastes. The list runs both Jabba The Hutt and Jabba (the Jabba's Palace card), as posted.",
